  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir green onion in hot butter briefly, then add rice. Cook and stir until rice is toasted, 2 to 3 minutes. Pour in water; season with chicken bouillon and pepper. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to medium-low. Cover and simmer for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
